@host = http://localhost:5082
@productId = 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
@orderId = 22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222

### Health
GET {{host}}/health

### Provision stock for a product
# Stock does not resolve productId against Catalog: it is a leaf service.
# @name setStock
POST {{host}}/api/v1/stock
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-Id: stock-smoke

{
  "productId": "{{productId}}",
  "quantityOnHand": 10
}

### Provisioning the same product again -> 409
POST {{host}}/api/v1/stock
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": "{{productId}}",
  "quantityOnHand": 5
}

### Read the position
GET {{host}}/api/v1/stock/{{productId}}

### Update the physical count (cannot go below what is reserved)
PUT {{host}}/api/v1/stock/{{productId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "quantityOnHand": 25
}

### Reserve 4 units for an order
# @name reserve
POST {{host}}/api/v1/stock/{{productId}}/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": "{{orderId}}",
  "quantity": 4
}

### Reserve again for the same order and product -> 409 (natural idempotency)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/stock/{{productId}}/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": "{{orderId}}",
  "quantity": 4
}

### Reserve more than is available -> 409 with both numbers
POST {{host}}/api/v1/stock/{{productId}}/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": "33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333",
  "quantity": 100000
}

### List every reservation for an order (the compensation path)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/reservations?orderId={{orderId}}

### List without an orderId -> 400
GET {{host}}/api/v1/reservations

### Confirm a reservation -> on-hand and reserved both drop
# Replace the id with the one returned by `reserve`.
POST {{host}}/api/v1/reservations/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/confirm

### Confirm the same reservation again -> 409 already confirmed
POST {{host}}/api/v1/reservations/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/confirm

### Release a reservation -> reserved drops, on-hand untouched
POST {{host}}/api/v1/reservations/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/release

### Unknown reservation -> 404
POST {{host}}/api/v1/reservations/44444444-4444-4444-4444-444444444444/confirm

### Unknown product -> 404
GET {{host}}/api/v1/stock/55555555-5555-5555-5555-555555555555

### Negative quantity -> 400 ValidationProblemDetails
POST {{host}}/api/v1/stock
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": "66666666-6666-6666-6666-666666666666",
  "quantityOnHand": -5
}

### Malformed JSON -> 400 ProblemDetails (never a 500)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/stock
Content-Type: application/json

{
